<script setup lang="ts">import type {Run} from '../types/domain';import {number} from '../utils/format';defineProps<{run:Run}>();</script><template><section class="method-summary"><p class="eyebrow">MEASUREMENT / {{run.result.n}} PAIRED SAMPLES</p><h2>{{run.result.instrument_codes?.join(' ↔ ')}}</h2><dl><div><dt>Deming 斜率</dt><dd>{{number(run.result.slope,4)}}</dd></div><div><dt>截距 / 百分点</dt><dd>{{number(run.result.intercept,3)}}</dd></div><div><dt>平均偏差 Y−X</dt><dd>{{number(run.result.bias,3)}}</dd></div><div><dt>95% 一致性界限</dt><dd>{{number(run.result.loa_lower,2)}} / {{number(run.result.loa_upper,2)}}</dd></div></dl><p class="verdict" :class="run.result.raw_eligible?'eligible':'restricted'">{{run.result.raw_eligible?'满足本次原值互换数值门槛':'原值互换门槛未满足'}}</p><small>允许误差 ±{{run.allowance}} 百分点；依据界限的外侧bootstrap CI，不依据相关系数。</small><p v-if="run.result.heteroscedastic_warning" class="caution">高低范围差值波动比 {{number(run.result.spread_ratio,2)}}；存在异方差线索，整体界限仅供描述。</p></section></template>
